  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- The track comes from a different show: Crystal Ballroom, Portland, OR, on 9/29/03 [1]\n- This version is taken from the Bonnaroo Festival in Manchester, TN, on 6/12/04 [1]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **01It's Gonna Be a Long Night**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **02Zoloft**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **03Transdermal Celebration**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **04Among His Tribe**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **05Ooh Va La**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **06Tried and True**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **07Happy Colored Marbles**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **08Hey There Fancy Pants**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **ween2003-00-00** (recommended): source not stated; 15 songs; 80 min [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **ween2003-00-00**: taped by Various; transferred by Various; source: Various [1]. Also: Fuzzface, a Browntracker user, compiled this between 2005 and 2007, mirroring a Ween studio album with the best unreleased live versions found [1]",
